<title>SPAIN: Spain's Repsol closes at all-time high.</title>
<headline>Spain's Repsol closes at all-time high.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Spanish energy group Repsol added 140 pesetas to close at an all-time high of 6,150 pesetas on Wednesday amid heavy volume, bolstered by foreign investor buying, dealers said.</p>
<p>It added 2.33 percent, easily outstripping the Ibex-35 index of leading shares, which rose 0.81 percent ot 5,527.24.</p>
<p>The government is selling its last 10.0 percent stake -- some 30 million shares -- this month.</p>
</text>
